  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Creatures who are subject to your feel the love compulsion will suffer for their love.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 6th level compulsions (Dynamic Warrior), evil alignment.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Creatures who are subject to your feel the love compulsion only determine the target of their affection from your visible allies. Furthermore, the compulsion is not broken prematurely if the target of the compelled creature’s affections acts hostile towards them.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
